WEBVTT

00:22:27.940 --> 00:22:30.742
Learn more at jobs.hilton.com.

00:22:35.103 --> 00:22:42.103
(Music)

00:22:47.080 --> 00:22:50.576
AG: Procrastination
is the opposite of productivity.

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:52.116
It's wasting time,

00:22:52.140 --> 00:22:54.906
or at least using it pretty inefficiently.

00:22:54.930 --> 00:22:57.376
We've talked about
how individuals can avoid that,

00:22:57.400 --> 00:23:00.846
but I also want to know
what organizations can do about it,